<section class="thesis">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Better agents need more than better models.</h2>
    <p>
      They need a reliable connection to the world. They need a way to build on useful work instead
      of repeating it. And the people relying on them need to see where their answers came from.
    </p>
    <p class="thesis-close">That&rsquo;s what we&rsquo;re building.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="infrastructure" class="infra">
  <div class="container">
